<title>INDIA: Indian soybean prices steady in light trade.</title>
<headline>Indian soybean prices steady in light trade.</headline>
<dateline>INDORE, India 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Soybean prices were steady in light trade on Thursday, with most central India markets closed for local holidays, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said soyoil prices were steady with a steady undertone in limited trade.</p>
<p>Soymeal and rapeseed extraction prices were also steady as export demand was limited at higher prices, they said. Soymeal yellow was $273-274 per tonne in export.</p>
<p>Rapeseed extraction was $135 per tonne in export. Rapeseed extraction was 4,600 rupees FOR Bedibunder and 4,550-4,575 rupees FOR Bhavnagar.</p>
